  id: convoy
  title: 4. Notes of Hot Radiator
  region: Copperline Boulevard
  briefing: Escort a dispensary's evidence van through three interception points.
    The cargo is financial records. Protect the van and stay near it to keep the
    driver moving.
  opening: 'Ivo: Our new release has notes of limestone after rain. Mara: Your van
    has notes of rocket in radiator. Follow us, slowly.'
  midpoint: 'Ivo: Sunsprawl wanted our customer data as collateral. We sell aroma
    descriptions, Mara. Some of those descriptions are private.'
  closing: 'Ivo: A triumphant finish with subtle hints of unpaid municipal bonds.
    Mara: Please let a bank describe a bank for once.'
  optionalObjective: Destroy at least 8 hostile vehicles
  contentOrder: 3
  reward: 1150
  enemyCount: 6
  targetCount: 3
  timeLimit: 480
  objectiveDuration: 45
  mode: 3
  optionalKind: 5
  optionalThreshold: 8
